# Supermarket Billing System

## Project Description
The Supermarket Billing System is a Python program developed for SmartBuy Supermarket. It automates product data entry, total bill calculations, promotional discount evaluation, and generates structured receipts.

## How the Program Works
1. Accepts product name, quantity, and unit price.
2. Stores item entries in lists.
3. Calculates the subtotal and applies a 10% discount if the subtotal exceeds Le 500.
4. Displays a formatted receipt.
5. Prompts the cashier to process additional customers continuously.

## How to Run the Program
1. Open any terminal or online Python compiler.
2. Run `main.py`.
3. Follow the on-screen prompts to enter product items.
